{"4919130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MONSTERGOTCHI", "steam_appid": 4919130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4919130/extras/4f8ada19ec5452454d6dc37e98b6ef51.poster.avif?t=1784271440\" width=514 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4919130/extras/4f8ada19ec5452454d6dc37e98b6ef51.webm?t=1784271440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4919130/extras/4f8ada19ec5452454d6dc37e98b6ef51.mp4?t=1784271440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>GROW YOUR OWN MONSTER!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MONSTERGOTCHI</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >is a virtual pet game inspired by the 90s and the FMV genre. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise a pet-creature by feeding them in your attic! 🍎</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed them whatever you find while exploring the streets! 🍽</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Or strictly follow the pet's orders 🤔. The choice is yours. The consequences are, too 😁</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have few types of pets! 🐱</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What breed you get depends entirely on your choices and diet management! 😋</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful—<strong>it wants to</strong> <strong>eat</strong>!!! 🥹</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well... It has been a couple of weeks since you moved into your new house, but you still haven't checked the attic. Well, now is the time. However, you can't possibly imagine what you are about to see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a strange, vintage computer up here... and...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is that thing  lying beneath the gap in the roof?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The strange vibrating goo on the floor...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Whatever it is, you won't be sleeping peacefully anymore. You begin hearing ominous voices.  It's like it's this thing on the floor. It's giving the orders to you. It's calling for you. It has a wild, desperate craving.  It needs your help. To grow. You can't resist. Your feet move on their own, drawing you back to the attic stairs...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>Well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GOOD LUCK.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4919130/extras/4f8ada19ec5452454d6dc37e98b6ef51.poster.avif?t=1784271440\" width=514 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4919130/extras/4f8ada19ec5452454d6dc37e98b6ef51.webm?t=1784271440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4919130/extras/4f8ada19ec5452454d6dc37e98b6ef51.mp4?t=1784271440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>GROW YOUR OWN MONSTER!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MONSTERGOTCHI</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >is a virtual pet game inspired by the 90s and the FMV genre. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise a pet-creature by feeding them in your attic! 🍎</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed them whatever you find while exploring the streets! 🍽</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Or strictly follow the pet's orders 🤔. The choice is yours. The consequences are, too 😁</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have few types of pets! 🐱</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What breed you get depends entirely on your choices and diet management! 😋</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful—<strong>it wants to</strong> <strong>eat</strong>!!! 🥹</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well... It has been a couple of weeks since you moved into your new house, but you still haven't checked the attic. Well, now is the time. However, you can't possibly imagine what you are about to see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a strange, vintage computer up here... and...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is that thing  lying beneath the gap in the roof?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The strange vibrating goo on the floor...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Whatever it is, you won't be sleeping peacefully anymore. You begin hearing ominous voices.  It's like it's this thing on the floor. It's giving the orders to you. It's calling for you. It has a wild, desperate craving.  It needs your help. To grow. You can't resist. Your feet move on their own, drawing you back to the attic stairs...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>Well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GOOD LUCK.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Feed and grow your own monster in the virtual pet game MONSTERGOTCHI! 😀 The type of pet you get depends entirely on you!😮 Explore a dangerous world, find food, and give it to them! 😍 Hurry up, IT'S HUNGRY!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a